BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[SC] Goblin Walk
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261030T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261030T173000
DTSTAMP:20261026T190345Z
UID:sancarlos-1130@local-events
DESCRIPTION:It's the spookiest time of the year\, when the tiniest ghouls 
 and ghosts haunt Downtown San Carlos in search of CANDY! Children 7 years 
 and under\, accompanied by an adult\, are invited to Trick-or-Treat down L
 aurel Street from San Carlos Avenue to Arroyo Avenue in their costume and 
 visit the businesses displaying a Goblin Walk sign. The first 600 Trick-or
 -Treaters can pick up a Goblin Walk Trick-or-Treat bag at the Parks &amp\;
  Recreation tent or from any Goblin Walk volunteer!\n\nAges: All ages\nSou
 rce: https://www.cityofsancarlos.org/business_detail_T10_R151.php\nLast sy
 nced: 2026-10-26 12:03 PDT
LOCATION:600-800 Blocks Laurel Street
URL:https://www.cityofsancarlos.org/business_detail_T10_R151.php
END:VEVENT
